<title>UK: London gold fixes touch easier in steady market.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes touch easier in steady market.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $324.10 vs $324.50 AM. Steady in tight range following hectic movements Thursday.</p>
<p>SILVER - Slightly firmer with gold at $4.31/$4.33.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Off intraday highs over $428.00 but still $1.00 ahead at $420.00/$423.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Down $4.50 at $197.00/$200.00.</p>
</text>
